# Market Gnome: "When this creature is exiled from the battlefield while you're activating a craft ability, you gain 1 life
# and draw a card." Bot1 crafts Dire Flail ("Craft with artifact {3}{R}{R}") choosing the Gnome, an artifact creature, as the
# material: it is exiled as the cost is paid (CR 602.2b, 601.2h), and its trigger goes on the stack above the craft ability
# (the 2023-11-10 ruling) - two objects, the Gnome's on top - so Bot1 has gained the life and drawn before Dire Blunderbuss
# returns. The Gnome is exiled, not dead, so its first ability does nothing: one life and one card, not two.

